      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There is a planned feature to add a world tab to the quick menu, and the world can put some controls in there. Could implement a button to emit particles from the player. That might be worth a shot if it shows up and this feature isn't implement by then.\n\nThe emoji are particles that just happen to be big.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
