  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-12T22:17:15.835Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I thought it would be a cool idea to have worlds that use custom emojis that can be located in a player's rotary emoji menu. \n\nMaybe the back-end upload function could be a special area or tab in the VRChat Unity SDK. It would be a good idea that the SDK should provide a notice of the Emoji size and resolution.\n\nTaking it a step further, it would also be cool to assign particle effects with the emoji. \n\nLastly, I also recommend a particle limiter to prevent malicious behaviors such as spamming and an emoji cool down time.",
